WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:03.440
The day 
of Shun's 
tournament

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:08.450
This is the place, right?

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.600
Yes, I think so.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.330
Shun-kun said he'd come find 
us near the entrance...

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.290
Hayate-san, Mima-san!

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:16.650
Shun-kun.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:19.490
Yuzumi High School 
Handball Team

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.150
Thanks for coming!

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.500
Thank you for inviting me.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.890
But I didn't know that you were 
invited as well, Mima-san.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:27.090
He said it's because he couldn't show 
his good side when we met in the park.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.790
You won't be seeing anything 
that disgraceful from me again.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.580
Good luck.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.390
<b>Futami</b>

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.390
<b>I forgot to say</b>

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.390
<b>Futami</b>

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.390
<b>I have a tournament this weekend,

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.390
<b>interested.  Since I haven't been</b>

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.390
<b>able to impress you at all.</b>

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.960
<i>That's the same reason he gave me.</i>

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.390
<i>He's really dying to show off his good side.</i>

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:38.860
Huh?

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.120
Did you not invite Souma-kun?

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.700
Aren't you close?

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.770
Well, I did invite him because 
he said he wanted to watch.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.290
But apparently...

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.150
he got on the wrong train.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:29.000
<b>#12 
Progress</b>

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.950
<i>I got on the wrong line.</i>

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:32.660
<i>I wanted to cheer him on because their spot at the Inter-High is on the line.</i>

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.800
<b>Shun! This weekend

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:35.740
<i>Shun! This weekend is finally it, right?</i>

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.430
<b>Mind if I come watch?</b>

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:36.940
<i>Mind if I come watch?</i>

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:40.180
<b>I don't mind</b>

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.140
<i>I don't mind.</i>

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:42.800
<b>Yay!</b>

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:39.190
<i>Yay!</i>

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:41.800
<i>I'll bring my camera, so do some cool stuff!</i>

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.800
<b>I'll bring my camera, 

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:42.800
<b>Of course I will</b>

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:42.790
<i>Of course I will.</i>

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.670
<i>I wonder if I'll make it on time.</i>

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.440
He's probably not going to make it.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:49.440
<b>Honest</b>

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.970
But there might be a chance that 
he'll just barely make it, right?

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:56.860
No, he got on a completely wrong 
train line, so it's not happening.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.660
I see.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.560
Futami, what are you doing? Let's go.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.300
Okay.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.040
Well, I'm off, then.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.740
Please take care of the Souma situation.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:05.890
Sure.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:06.960
Understood.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.260
Hey, it's this way.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:10.770
I know.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:11.610
Liar.

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:12.920
It's part of my warmup.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:16.630
<b>Younger Group</b>

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.300
<i>I wonder if those kids will be okay...</i>

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:26.980
Senpai...

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:30.930
I want to keep playing with 
you guys as much as possible,

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.400
so I'm going to cherish today's matches—

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.360
<b>Bam</b>

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.860
<b>Totally the
 same age
as him</b>

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.150
Totally. I feel the same way.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:36.860
Let's do our best!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.620
I wasn't talking to you.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.740
What? You were looking at me.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.490
Senpai?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.950
Thanks, we feel the same way.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.120
<b><i>Hype hype hype hype</i></b>

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.130
<i>We have to win this!</i>

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.300
<b><i>Hype hype 

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:56.370
<i>Win, win, win, win, win, win, win, win.</i>

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:56.520
Futami, your arms and legs 
are moving in unison.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.560
It's on purpose.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.840
<i>Seriously, is he okay?</i>

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.090
Futami!? You should have had that!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:15.760
Okay, go!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.140
Wha—?!

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:20.300
Futami! You could have taken 
the shot! Don't hesitate!

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.030
Normally you get those!

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:23.740
Sorry.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.400
Something's off.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.130
Shun-chan...

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.110
Don't tell me...

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.710
<b>Boom</b>

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.390
He's nervous?!

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:33.840
<i>Win, win.</i>

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.360
Do you think Shun-kun is all right?

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.590
Looks like he's not quite in form.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.040
Hayate-kun, Mima-san.

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:41.430
Souma-kun!

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:42.510
Sorry for being late.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.780
I'm glad you made it here.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.980
We heard you got on the wrong train.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.120
Yeah, but I'm fine.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:52.150
Once I make a mistake, I don't 
think I'll make the same one again.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:53.300
<i>He's an optimist.</i>

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:54.630
I'm so glad.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.110
The game's still going.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.730
So where's Shun?

00:04:58.430 --> 00:04:59.390
There!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.860
Shun looks cool.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:05.810
Yeah, but it looks like 
he's not doing so well.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.290
Oh, really?

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.730
He might be nervous.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:12.920
Shun!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.280
You got this!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.120
<i>Oh, he made it.</i>

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.340
I'm ready to take pictures too!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.670
<b>Tada!</b>

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.770
<i>He's doing the exact same 
thing he did back then.</i>

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:27.540
<i>So lame...</i>

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:28.230
<i>Wait.</i>

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.040
<i>I'm the lamest person here.</i>

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.450
<i>I want to keep playing with my senpais.</i>

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.110
<i>Hayate-san helped me out so much, too.</i>

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.250
<i>Mima-san only saw me embarrass myself...</i>

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.240
<b>Slide</b>

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.500
It's really cool how you 
can brush things off.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:55.370
<i>I was thinking that having the capacity 
to laugh it off is way more impressive...</i>

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.420
Futami!

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:57.570
<i>I also want to...</i>

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.420
<i>I also want to...</i>

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.310
<i>become someone who can 
move forward like that!</i>

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.550
Shun-kun's so cool!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.930
Souma's Perspective

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.700
Huh?

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:20.040
Oh, looks like Shun-kun's 
getting back into form.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.050
Handball's so cool.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:26.170
What's the matter? Are you 
all right, Souma-kun?

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.760
All I could see was black.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.560
Huh? Are you okay?

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:31.970
<i>I'll get it next time.</i>

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.360
<i>If you have to have lame moments 
no matter how you live,</i>

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:43.700
<i>then I want to at least be 
a guy who can laugh them off.</i>

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:49.140
We lost...

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:53.290
Well, it's not like we ever made 
it further than the quarterfinals.

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:54.590
The other teams are strong, too.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:07:00.490
I guess we couldn't break the curse of 
always dropping out after 3-4 rounds.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.310
A reality check, huh?

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.700
No, we'll make it to the Inter-High.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.840
What's this, coming from the guy who wasn't 
pulling his weight in the beginning?

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.290
You messing with me?

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:10.810
I'm honestly sorry about that.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:17.650
Well, it was good that you managed 
to overcome that by yourself, though.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.950
Thanks for doing your part.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.490
It was no big deal...

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:23.290
<b>Blush...</b>

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:24.770
Oh, he's sembarrassed.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.760
You're really cute, you know?

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.800
What do you mean by cute?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.400
And I'm not embarrassed.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.250
Okay, okay.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:35.240
Since you're retired now, please 
don't come to practice anymore.

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.440
You wish.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.920
We'll come by in the 
summer from time to time.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:39.480
Right?

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:42.690
Seriously? Should we play an alum game then?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.820
Nah, I'll be studying for my exams.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.220
You should study too.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.510
I am!

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:48.650
Well, at least I think so.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.750
Well, now that this chapter 
of the club is over,

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.940
it's time to seriously 
start studying for exams.

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:54.240
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.690
Must be nice to easily get a great 
rating for the school you want to go to.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.150
It's not out of your reach if you try.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:04.220
Senpai, could it actually be that 
we'll be in the same grade next year?

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.510
It's not like I'm Futami, so 
that's not happening.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:07.500
What is that supposed to mean?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.530
Hey, let's get some ice cream.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.880
Your treat, Senpai.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.150
I don't have any money.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:14.620
<i>Ah</i>

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.380
<i>Today too</i>

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:20.510
<i>we're repeating silly mistakes</i>

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:23.530
<i>I need to become stronger myself.</i>

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:24.040
<i>When we come to, we're in a unknown place</i>

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:27.060
<i>We have the map on our phone in one hand</i>

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:33.050
<i>So when did we stray from 
the route we were on</i>

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.320
That song...

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.530
Hello?

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.100
Oh, hello.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.140
It's Shirakawa.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.560
Could you tell me where you are right now?

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.910
Shinjuku, East Gate?

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.140
I knew it.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.000
<b>Sigh</b>

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:53.040
<i>We agreed to meet at the South Exit.</i>

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.960
<i>South. Exit.</i>

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.220
Oh, really? Sorry.

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:01.020
I was waiting for quite some time, so 
I suspected that you goofed again.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:04.130
<i>Sighing lets your happiness escape.</i>

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:06.820
Whose fault do you think that is?!

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:08.930
<i>More importantly, listen to this.</i>

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:13.650
I passed by a young guy 
singing the song I wrote.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.410
Yeah, yeah, yeah. That's amazing.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.780
We're already cutting it 
close for the meeting,

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.150
so please don't move from 
where you are right now.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.490
<i>Did you get that?!</i>

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:21.530
<i>Igarashi-sensei!?</i>

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:24.570
She hung up.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:29.360
Shirakawa-chan's mad again today.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:04.970
<b>Coming up next</b>

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:04.970
<b>Reunion</b>

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>
